WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.580
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier and welcome to "Infectionator 2"

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:05.000
and this is another flash game

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.000
and I know I've been playing a lot of flash games lately

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.780
but this is a good one

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:10.260
and I'm actually good at the game

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.000
which means I can show you how it's done without worrying too much

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
so the game is basically a zombie infection simulator

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.740
but not like pandemic or anything like that

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.900
what it is, is you start the zombie infection

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.400
and then they, of their own volition,

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.140
will go out into the entire world and then dominate

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:33.140
devastate, and kill everyone in the entire city that you're in

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.660
and then you go around, throughout the world

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:39.240
trying to make as many people go blurg  and die

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:41.880
because that's how people die in my mind the go blaurgh

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:44.460
and then you conquer the world with your zombies

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:49.820
so the first city is Bejing because for some reason a lot of zombie stories start in China?

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.060
and I don't even know why

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:54.960
If anyone has read the Zombie survival guide, handbook

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.960
it's a very interesting read but

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:02.720
I believe that as well has the zombie apocalypse starting from patient zero somewhere in China?

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:07.480
And, I don't know what they have against China... I personally don't have anything against China.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:11.460
And also there's this lady who has way too much cleavage popping out of her shirt.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:16.940
Anyway so you keep doing these over and over and there's specific objectives for these various levels

00:01:16.940 --> 00:01:22.820
And eventually I'll get them good here, but I haven't bought any power ups yet because I don't have enough money to do so

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:29.760
And you continually level up over and over, through getting money and killing more and more people and your zombies become stronger and stronger

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:35.180
And then you get BONUS zombies, and then you get special-ultra-mega zombies, and then you get special items

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:45.520
And grenades that can blow things up and your ideal objective is to make sure that every city in the entire world is completely destroyed....

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:48.240
SO. Do you get it? D'you understand? It's

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:53.720
really cool. Now also if you go back to a city, you'll realize that there are objectives in the specific city.

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:59.440
Kill all in 40 seconds, gather 150 gold, kill one people with support, and then do it with no support.

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:05.400
So if you do that, the entire city will never ever ever rise from the ashes again and it will be gone forever

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:10.700
Which is either good or bad depending on your perspective on zombies and zombie apocalypses in general.

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:14.720
SO, that's my big spiel and now I'm done

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:18.240
Because apparently this didn't work, god damn it

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:23.260
See that didn't do anything because I only got one

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:29.560
Also, it's important to know that your - your zombie infection thing in the beginning has a spray pattern

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:35.220
Originally it goes in a cross-diagonal-plus sign, and then you'll eventually get more directions

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:38.500
If that sounds complicated and you have no idea what I'm talking about

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.500
You will in a second. So before I do that,

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:44.460
I'ma going to go to the next city so I can at least get bonus gold from this one

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:47.020
'cuz I suck

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:50.100
But I do know what I'm doing even though I suck

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.100
[stutter] Don't pay attention to that

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:52.900
Nothing about that makes sense.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.900
Okay, so now I'm at the upgrade screen

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.440
and I actually have enough to be able to do these upgrades

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:59.440
Which make it slightly better

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:02.640
Slightly better. Not a lot better but slightly better

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:05.640
and slightly better is all we really need

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:06.640
Blecgh

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:09.080
There we go, there we go. This is getting better

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.700
That's more like it. Yeah. Yeah!

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:14.900
Yeeeah! Yeeaah!

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:18.280
Alright! So now we can get gre-NAH-des [grenades]

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:21.420
which are important because you want to be able to blow everything up

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:23.420
and once this is completely destroyed

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:25.420
kill one people with support is literally all I really need to do

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.420
Ha-bubrrrbp!

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:29.420
Look at that. Look at [muttering]

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:32.640
And then you can put all that down and kill everybody anyway

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:35.340
and then that's the end of that one. You get a thousand bonus gold.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:37.340
and that's how you make a lot of progress in the game

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:39.340
It took me a while to realise that.

00:03:39.340 --> 00:03:41.340
I didn't even understand what the mechanics of it was

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:43.340
at the first time that I did that.

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:45.340
But now, things are better.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.820
Now I can move on to the next one and hopefully be able to do that

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.440
Bang. There we go. Got it.

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:53.800
Got it. Killed everybody. Killed one with grenade support.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.380
That was a another one thing

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.800
And that was it! That was everything I needed to do for that one!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.800
Yeah! Do you see what I mean?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.800
Anyway, this game gets bigger and bigger

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.700
as you go through out the entire world and kill everybody in the entire world

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:08.200
[excitedly] And dominate everybody in every sector of anything that's going on here!

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:11.680
