00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.900
Ones that are police officers and such

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.080
and you wanna make sure that you get them first

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.900
so that they don't shoot your zombies

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.480
and kill 'em before they have a chance to infect everybody

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:30.440
Which is actually kind of... kind of difficult to do

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:33.340
because in the beginning of the game, your chance of

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:35.340
them getting infected after you bite them

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:37.720
and murder them is actually kinda low

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.720
